WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.938
The waiting room shows who has checked in, and who is next.

2
00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:11.344
A student gives their ID, or checks in at the kiosk themselves.

3
00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:15.625
Optionally, what they want help with.

4
00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:18.516
One click checks them in.

5
00:00:18.516 --> 00:00:22.532
The tutor sees them waiting, and walk-in counts feed the center's reports.
